name: Host State Act (HSA)
description: SR 192.12 — Federal Act of 22 June 2007 on the Privileges, Immunities and Facilities and the Financial Subsidies granted by Switzerland as a Host State (Host State Act, HSA). Unofficial English mirror of the Fedlex consolidation of 1 November 2022. No legal force.
